{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/242548-now-available-flowers-of-hell-demon-players-guide","id":242548,"title":"Now Available! Flowers of Hell: Demon Players Guide","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-27T14:41:33-07:00","id":242548,"title":"Now Available! Flowers of Hell: Demon Players Guide","content":"<img src=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/images/4261/131419.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/131419/Flowers-of-Hell-The-Demon-Players-Guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/131419/Flowers-of-Hell-The-Demon-Players-Guide</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>I want to be human, sometimes. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>I think about what they have and how simple it all must be. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>Even if they aren't sure of their identities, at least for them the question is multiple choice. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>A human can only be so many different things. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>But to really survive after the Fall, you have to let go of everything, including identity. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>It has to be constantly changing. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>That's the only way you can stay hidden - never give the Machine something to zero in on. </i></span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">-Comrade West</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Flowers of Hell: The Demon Players Guide </b>expands on the material presented in <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/124155?src=FlowerstoHell\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Demon: The Descent</b></a>, with additional information on the Agendas, the Unchained condition and mindset, and how the reason for the Fall - the catalyst - affects game play and character development. You'll also find rules for suborning Infrastructure and what kinds of risks and rewards it brings. </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The book also includes a plethora of new Embeds, Exploits, demonic form abilities, and Merits, as well as an entire chapter on Gadgets and how they can make your demon's Descent easier...or at least, much more interesting.</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}